WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.015
The team now has a door of its own. The admin console opens to staff, and only to

00:00:07.015 --> 00:00:07.687
staff.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.729
Staff sign in with their work email and password, and land on the Dashboard, with

00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:15.072
their name and role in the sidebar.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.915
A member without a staff role is told the console is for the team. Wrong credentials

00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:25.438
get one message that never says which.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.146
Four areas sit in the sidebar. Choose one, and it opens without reloading the page,

00:00:33.146 --> 00:00:35.120
marked as the current page.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.934
On a phone or tablet, the sidebar becomes a band. The links scroll within it, and

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.696
Sign out stays in reach.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.830
Open a staff page without a session, and you are taken to sign in. If the server

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.518
fails, you are told so.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.059
On the server, every admin endpoint needs a staff session, in its own strict cookie.

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:03.346
A member's session opens nothing.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.504
Next, the second step, and the lockout.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.072
That's slice nine point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:23.072 --> 00:01:24.350
body and spirit.
